  "translation": "Magĩrĩkuuma Midiyani, makĩinũra Parani, makĩrata andũ arĩa hamwe na maco kuuma Parani, makĩingata Micirayimu, kũrĩ Firao mwathi wa Micirayimu, ũrĩa oimĩrire ũrĩa wegĩrĩire amũhe nyũmba na irio, we nyũmba nĩamũheereire, amũheterete irio, na gĩthaka nĩamũheereire.",
